WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Private request: asterisks grow with every typed character.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.400
Only the name and availability enter the conversation.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.600
secure_exec authenticates to localhost. Build 184 passed.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.300
/secret show BUILD_TOKEN opens the masked local dialog.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:12.000
R asks for confirmation. Y reveals locally.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.800
Synthetic token only. R hides it; Enter closes. No clipboard.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.700
/secret list: scroll through names and select a secret.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:22.000
Enter opens the selected secret, masked. Close to return.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:25.700
D asks to forget the selection. Y confirms.

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.000
The browser refreshes: the selected name is gone.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.500
/secret clear forgets the remaining in-memory secrets.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.000
Transcript hygiene, not a sandbox. Clearing cannot erase recordings.
